urname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Anagnostopoulos</surname><given-names>GK</given-names></name><name><surname>Katsaounos</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Filis</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Missas</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Inflammatory fibroid polyp of the small intestine causing intussusception: a report of two cases</article-title><source>Dig Dis Sci</source><year>2004</year><volume>49</volume><fpage>1677</fpage><lpage>1680</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15573926</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1023/B:DDAS.0000043385.44842.c8</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Anthony</surname><given-names>PP</given-names></name><name><surname>Morris</surname><given-names>DS</given-names></name><name><surname>Vowles</surname><given-names>KD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Multiple and recurrent inflammatory fibroid polyps in three generations of a Devon family: a new syndrome</article-title><source>Gut</source><year>1984</year><volume>25</volume><fpage>854</fpage><lpage>862</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6745724</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1136/gut.25.8.854</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>